sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant A as API
  participant D as MongoDB
  C->>A: POST /api/auth/login
  A->>D: verify bcrypt hash
  A-->>C: access token + refresh token (JTI)
  C->>A: request with access token
  A-->>C: 401 when expired
  C->>A: POST /api/auth/refresh-token
  A->>D: check JTI, revoke old, store new
  A-->>C: new token pair
